Exception	HTTP status	Error code
Account not found	404	ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND
Insufficient balance	422	INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
Account blocked	403	ACCOUNT_BLOCKED
Invalid request	400	INVALID_REQUEST
Validation failure	400	VALIDATION_FAILED
Duplicate account	409	ACCOUNT_ALREADY_EXISTS
Unexpected exception	500	INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR


